1
00:00:00,544 --> 00:00:03,254
-♪ Sheldon and his brain... ♪
-Definitely better before.

2
00:00:05,216 --> 00:00:07,256
(Howard:)So, I'm almost done
writing the song for Bernadette.

3
00:00:07,418 --> 00:00:08,658
(Howard:)Are you cool playing the cello?

4
00:00:08,819 --> 00:00:11,489
If by "cool"
you mean "willing to," yes.

5
00:00:11,655 --> 00:00:13,225
If by "cool" you mean "cool,"

6
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:15,300
(Leonard:)clearly you've never seen me
play the cello.

7
00:00:16,293 --> 00:00:18,133
(Howard:)Great. Will you play the ukulele?

8
00:00:18,295 --> 00:00:21,175
(Raj:)Of course. I'd be happy
to shred it on my ax.

9
00:00:22,666 --> 00:00:26,276
(Howard:)Or you could just play your tiny,
ridiculous guitar.

10
00:00:28,639 --> 00:00:30,519
(Raj:)Fine. I will melt her heart.

11
00:00:31,408 --> 00:00:33,478
And her face!

12
00:00:35,513 --> 00:00:36,923
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen.

13
00:00:37,081 --> 00:00:39,251
(Sheldon:)No doubt you heard
about my little breakthrough.

14
00:00:39,416 --> 00:00:42,456
(Sheldon:)Now, if your plan
is to hoist me on your shoulders

15
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:44,790
(Sheldon:)and carry me around the cafeteria,
please refrain.

16
00:00:44,955 --> 00:00:47,295
(Sheldon:)I don't care for heights,
motion sickness

17
00:00:47,458 --> 00:00:49,958
(Sheldon:)or the thought of your necks
touching my buttocks.

18
00:00:51,829 --> 00:00:53,539
(Howard:)Seriously, congratulations, Sheldon.

19
00:00:53,697 --> 00:00:55,037
(Raj:)Yeah, I read your paper online.

